<title>POLAND: Polish bourse kerb bond deals - September 5.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse kerb bond deals - September 5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb trade through the Warsaw bourse on Thursday saw 9,828 fixed-interest five-year bonds maturing on June 12, 1999 trading at 94.25 zlotys.</p>
<p>Their turnover was 9.6 million zloyts.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
